# Out-of-tree kernel module build products.
#
# The module is cross-built straight into this directory:
#   make -C <kernel-tree> ARCH=arm64 CROSS_COMPILE=aarch64-linux-gnu- M=$PWD modules
# which leaves fifteen or so generated files here.  "make ... clean" removes them,
# but a build left uncleaned should not be able to reach a commit.
*.ko
*.o
*.mod
*.mod.c
*.cmd
Module.symvers
modules.order
